WEBVTT

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:34.210
Thank you for coming today.

00:00:34.210 --> 00:00:37.200
Blackblack, did we get a new job?

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:41.090
Do you want us to put one over on 
those periods, Haru and his friends?

00:00:41.090 --> 00:00:42.800
That's right.

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:46.130
Go all the way out to Remote Village
 and steal their job.

00:00:46.130 --> 00:00:46.960
Oh, crap.

00:00:46.960 --> 00:00:49.430
Remote Village is all the 
way out in the mountains!

00:00:49.430 --> 00:00:53.890
Well, you're paying us a fortune,

00:00:53.890 --> 00:00:55.150
so we'll do it.

00:00:59.320 --> 00:01:01.090
Have fun!

00:01:02.820 --> 00:01:04.830
<i>Campanella and Blackpanella...</i>

00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:09.250
<i>It's been three months since I 
started having two identities.</i>

00:01:09.870 --> 00:01:14.800
<i>Every day, as Campanella, 
I support Branch Office #8,</i>

00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:19.930
<i>and as Blackpanella, I have 
Wiseman steal Haru-kun's jobs.</i>

00:01:19.930 --> 00:01:23.200
<i>As for why I'm doing that...</i>

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:26.230
<i>It's a secret!</i>

00:01:50.540 --> 00:01:53.920
<b>~ the journey to the end of the despair ~</b>

00:02:58.070 --> 00:03:01.660
<b>Episode 6: Confessions of a Mask</b>

00:03:03.360 --> 00:03:09.640
<i>The morning paper has an article about a 
new theme park opening in the Blood Realm!</i>

00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:13.700
I'd love to go on a tour.

00:03:13.700 --> 00:03:15.090
A tour of what?

00:03:15.650 --> 00:03:16.500
Erika-san!

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:18.820
Oh, perfect timing!

00:03:18.820 --> 00:03:20.520
I mean... No, no.

00:03:20.520 --> 00:03:21.860
I can't tell you...

00:03:21.860 --> 00:03:24.190
I can't tell you that one 
of my long-held dreams is

00:03:24.190 --> 00:03:29.480
to make a theme park with all the 
ideas I've come up with, Campanelland,

00:03:29.480 --> 00:03:32.570
and that I want to go tour 
it to see what I can learn!

00:03:32.570 --> 00:03:37.040
Oh, you mean that plan you always 
tell me about when we go drinking?

00:03:37.040 --> 00:03:41.380
I'm afraid I can't allocate 
any of our budget for that.

00:03:41.380 --> 00:03:42.400
Of course.

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:44.810
I'll just pay for my own ticket, then.

00:03:45.360 --> 00:03:48.320
<i>But I don't want to go on my own,</i>

00:03:48.320 --> 00:03:51.260
<i>so I decided to invite Haru-kun 
and the others to join me.</i>

00:03:51.260 --> 00:03:54.170
Um, I don't mind going to a theme park,

00:03:54.170 --> 00:03:56.170
but it's in the Blood Realm, right?

00:03:56.420 --> 00:03:57.690
Yup!

00:03:57.690 --> 00:03:59.780
The Blood Realm, the country of witches!

00:03:59.780 --> 00:04:02.930
That's where Liza-san is from, right?

00:04:02.930 --> 00:04:04.380
Well, yeah, but...

00:04:04.380 --> 00:04:09.570
Wait, the Blood Realm is where 
my idol, Sapphire-san, lives!

00:04:09.570 --> 00:04:12.280
It's a long way away, right?

00:04:12.280 --> 00:04:13.420
I don't know if I have the money.

00:04:13.420 --> 00:04:16.270
Don't worry about the cost.

00:04:16.270 --> 00:04:18.020
I'll pay for it all.

00:04:18.520 --> 00:04:19.700
Seriously?

00:04:19.700 --> 00:04:21.540
Then it's just fine!

00:04:21.540 --> 00:04:22.960
Let's do it.

00:04:22.960 --> 00:04:24.200
How many years has it been?

00:04:25.570 --> 00:04:29.280
I want to eat booger-flavored 
jelly beans at the theme park.

00:04:29.280 --> 00:04:30.960
Don't.

00:04:30.960 --> 00:04:32.620
Earwax flavor, then.

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:33.750
No, I mean...

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:35.240
I mean, let's say no.

00:04:36.140 --> 00:04:40.090
Between getting to the Blood Realm
 and buying tickets for all of us,

00:04:40.090 --> 00:04:41.620
it's going to cost a ton.

00:04:41.620 --> 00:04:44.420
We can't ask her to do that.

00:04:44.420 --> 00:04:46.340
Oh, I see.

00:04:48.930 --> 00:04:50.750
Stupid honest Haru.

00:04:50.750 --> 00:04:53.310
<i>Unfortunately, they refused.</i>

00:04:53.310 --> 00:04:57.690
<i>So as Blackpanella, I asked 
Wiseman to go with us.</i>

00:05:00.370 --> 00:05:06.120
Well, you're paying us a fortune.

00:05:06.120 --> 00:05:08.780
Seriously, we don't have a choice.

00:05:08.780 --> 00:05:09.660
Yeah.

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:10.770
Guru...

00:05:10.770 --> 00:05:15.170
Okay, we'll leave
tomorrow morning. See you there.

00:05:15.170 --> 00:05:17.400
Okay, let's head back and get ready.

00:05:23.420 --> 00:05:24.770
So which rides do we go on?

00:05:24.770 --> 00:05:28.850
The paper said there was a 
"flying carpet" that really flies!

00:05:28.850 --> 00:05:29.710
Seriously?

00:05:29.710 --> 00:05:31.800
We've gotta ride that!

00:05:31.800 --> 00:05:32.850
Yeah, yeah.

00:05:32.850 --> 00:05:35.480
And I heard there's a 
roller coaster with no rails!

00:05:35.480 --> 00:05:37.640
We've gotta ride that, too!

00:05:37.640 --> 00:05:38.630
Yeah, yeah!

00:05:38.630 --> 00:05:42.020
There's a haunted house with real ghosts!

00:05:42.020 --> 00:05:43.270
We're not going to that one!

00:05:43.270 --> 00:05:44.360
Yeah, yeah!

00:05:44.920 --> 00:05:50.010
<i>And so, I headed to the 
Blood Realm with Wiseman.</i>

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:53.680
Why are we walking?

00:05:53.680 --> 00:05:56.280
Carriages can't cross these mountains.

00:05:56.280 --> 00:05:57.820
You've been told that a bunch of times.

00:05:57.820 --> 00:05:59.450
I have, a bunch,

00:05:59.450 --> 00:06:02.100
but no matter how many times 
I hear it, I want a carriage!

00:06:03.050 --> 00:06:05.360
Me, too.

00:06:05.360 --> 00:06:07.420
There's a little tea stand up ahead.

00:06:07.420 --> 00:06:09.130
Let's take a break there.

00:06:09.480 --> 00:06:10.640
Yay!

00:06:11.480 --> 00:06:12.590
We're here!

00:06:12.590 --> 00:06:13.850
Let's look at a menu.

00:06:14.300 --> 00:06:16.320
I'm going to the bathroom real quick.

00:06:25.010 --> 00:06:28.000
My mask's all sweaty after wearing 
it on that mountain hike.

00:06:28.000 --> 00:06:31.240
Oh, Campanella-san!

00:06:31.240 --> 00:06:32.570
<i>Haru-kun and his friends?</i>

00:06:32.570 --> 00:06:33.670
<i>Why?</i>

00:06:33.670 --> 00:06:35.040
<i>This isn't good!</i>

00:06:36.370 --> 00:06:38.210
We wanted to hurry and catch up with you,

00:06:38.210 --> 00:06:40.660
so we took a shortcut!

00:06:40.660 --> 00:06:43.460
By "shortcut," he means a game trail.

00:06:44.470 --> 00:06:46.860
We almost got lost.

00:06:46.860 --> 00:06:48.550
I'm glad we caught you, though.

00:06:49.280 --> 00:06:52.720
Erika-san said she was worried 
about you going alone.

00:06:52.720 --> 00:06:56.470
So she paid for our trip out 
of the Branch Office's funds!

00:06:59.760 --> 00:07:01.700
Are you okay?

00:07:01.700 --> 00:07:03.810
Of course, I'm fine.

00:07:03.810 --> 00:07:06.280
Um, what we were talking about?

00:07:06.280 --> 00:07:10.260
I was saying Erika-san paid for the trip.

00:07:10.260 --> 00:07:12.360
So we'd like to go with you.

00:07:13.280 --> 00:07:14.820
Is that a problem?

00:07:14.820 --> 00:07:16.370
No, no.

00:07:16.370 --> 00:07:18.590
Of course not! Why would it be?

00:07:18.590 --> 00:07:21.330
But before that, I'd like 
to go use the restroom.

00:07:21.330 --> 00:07:25.440
Oh, were you trying to pee out here?

00:07:25.440 --> 00:07:26.780
Hey, Gajeru!

00:07:26.780 --> 00:07:29.450
How can you say that to a lady?

00:07:31.210 --> 00:07:32.970
Sorry for the wait!

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:35.320
You took forever!

00:07:35.320 --> 00:07:36.140
Was it a big one?

00:07:36.140 --> 00:07:38.550
I suppose so.

00:07:38.550 --> 00:07:40.830
Decide what you're going to eat.

00:07:40.830 --> 00:07:42.800
No, I'll pass.

00:07:42.800 --> 00:07:45.040
Anyway, I forgot something.

00:07:45.040 --> 00:07:47.700
Can you guys go on without me?

00:07:47.700 --> 00:07:49.330
I'll catch up later.

00:07:50.550 --> 00:07:52.280
Want us to go back with you?

00:07:52.280 --> 00:07:53.800
No, no.

00:07:53.800 --> 00:07:58.910
Actually, you can go straight on ahead 
to the theme park, enjoy yourselves,

00:07:58.910 --> 00:08:00.330
and then go straight home.

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:03.200
But then we wouldn't be accompanying you.

00:08:03.200 --> 00:08:08.120
When Wiseman takes a job, 
we always see it through.

00:08:08.120 --> 00:08:09.050
Yeah, yeah.

00:08:09.440 --> 00:08:11.840
You're surprisingly serious 
about your work, huh?

00:08:11.840 --> 00:08:13.270
All right.

00:08:13.270 --> 00:08:15.370
Then I'll hurry back.

00:08:16.010 --> 00:08:20.350
<i>And so, I ended up journeying 
separately with both</i>

00:08:20.350 --> 00:08:23.110
<i>Haru-kun's group and Wiseman.</i>

00:08:41.400 --> 00:08:43.960
<i>I was having so much fun 
that time just flew by,</i>

00:08:43.960 --> 00:08:47.340
<i>and before long we were very 
close to the Blood Realm.</i>

00:08:48.310 --> 00:08:50.990
This place seems kind of ominous.

00:08:50.990 --> 00:08:52.210
This is the Witch's Forest.

00:08:52.620 --> 00:08:55.440
Once we're through here, we can 
make it to the Blood Realm.

00:08:55.440 --> 00:08:57.410
Then let's get going.

00:08:57.410 --> 00:08:58.680
But...

00:08:59.310 --> 00:09:04.440
If you don't have a witch to guide you, 
you'll wander the forest forever.

00:09:05.780 --> 00:09:08.290
Then we need to find a witch.

00:09:08.290 --> 00:09:09.930
Liza's a witch.

00:09:10.680 --> 00:09:11.680
Is she?

00:09:11.680 --> 00:09:13.280
That's the problem with monkeys.

00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:14.360
Eek eek!

00:09:14.360 --> 00:09:15.910
Don't call me a monkey!

00:09:15.910 --> 00:09:17.240
<i>What do I do?</i>

00:09:17.240 --> 00:09:20.990
<i>Wiseman went on ahead.</i>

00:09:27.290 --> 00:09:31.400
We keep walking, but we always
 end up back at this tree, guru.

00:09:31.400 --> 00:09:33.260
No more, please.

00:09:33.260 --> 00:09:36.950
Is the whole forest under a spell?

00:09:39.360 --> 00:09:42.860
Are we really going to die here?

00:09:47.390 --> 00:09:48.920
It's Zaku-tan, guru!

00:09:48.920 --> 00:09:50.360
Hello.

00:09:50.890 --> 00:09:52.270
Having a picnic?

00:09:52.270 --> 00:09:53.690
No!

00:09:59.560 --> 00:10:01.960
This is the exit.

00:10:01.960 --> 00:10:03.200
Hooray!

00:10:03.200 --> 00:10:04.200
Thank you!

00:10:04.200 --> 00:10:06.120
You saved us!

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:09.080
But Zaku-tan, what were you 
doing in a place like this?

00:10:09.410 --> 00:10:12.150
I live here.

00:10:12.150 --> 00:10:15.750
In the poison swamp that's way back there.

00:10:15.750 --> 00:10:17.610
You live here?

00:10:17.610 --> 00:10:20.270
You didn't know?

00:10:20.270 --> 00:10:25.370
All the people we call actually 
exist all over the world.

00:10:25.370 --> 00:10:28.430
Wow, I didn't know!

00:10:28.430 --> 00:10:30.850
It was really rough last time.

00:10:31.600 --> 00:10:33.610
The last time we summoned you?

00:10:34.090 --> 00:10:37.740
I was called when I was making medicine...

00:10:38.120 --> 00:10:43.700
And when I got back, all the poison 
frogs in the swamp had gotten super big.

00:10:44.560 --> 00:10:47.810
Well, sorry about that, guru.

00:10:47.810 --> 00:10:48.950
Seriously?

00:10:48.950 --> 00:10:52.600
Hearing that makes it 
harder for me to do calls.

00:10:52.600 --> 00:10:56.290
You can still call me any time you want.

00:10:56.290 --> 00:10:58.470
You don't mind, huh?

00:10:58.930 --> 00:11:04.640
<i>And so we all arrived at the Blood Realm.</i>

00:11:07.400 --> 00:11:08.530
<i>But...</i>

00:11:08.530 --> 00:11:11.020
<i>This is where it got really rough!</i>

00:11:14.020 --> 00:11:16.020
<b>~ the journey to the end of the despair ~</b>

00:11:26.840 --> 00:11:27.930
What? What? What?

00:11:27.930 --> 00:11:28.910
Seriously? Seriously? Seriously?

00:11:28.910 --> 00:11:30.920
Crazy! Crazy! Crazy! Crazy!

00:11:30.920 --> 00:11:33.360
I hear a lot of strange sounds.

00:11:33.360 --> 00:11:35.290
Yeah, yeah, yeah!

00:11:35.290 --> 00:11:37.000
Um, excuse me.

00:11:37.680 --> 00:11:39.030
What is it?

00:11:39.030 --> 00:11:42.940
I'm going to meet a local I know.

00:11:42.940 --> 00:11:45.840
Can you go do some sightseeing for a bit?

00:11:45.840 --> 00:11:49.640
Let's meet in front of Gate 2 at 
the theme park around lunchtime.

00:11:50.530 --> 00:11:51.760
Seriously?

00:11:51.760 --> 00:11:53.160
Fine.

00:11:53.160 --> 00:11:56.600
You know, you're always 
really busy with something.

00:11:57.600 --> 00:11:59.610
Sorry I'm always preoccupied.

00:12:10.360 --> 00:12:12.370
I've gotten a lot faster at that, huh?

00:12:13.920 --> 00:12:18.650
Campanella-san's always been busy with 
something when we were traveling.

00:12:18.650 --> 00:12:20.940
Is that just how she travels?

00:12:20.940 --> 00:12:23.780
I've never heard of somebody 
who travels like that.

00:12:23.780 --> 00:12:26.430
Hey, you're from here, right, Liza?

00:12:27.000 --> 00:12:30.700
Since you're here, are you
 going to stop home?

00:12:30.700 --> 00:12:34.190
Well, some stuff happened, so...

00:12:34.190 --> 00:12:36.440
It's still hard to go home.

00:12:36.440 --> 00:12:38.440
I know, Liza!

00:12:38.440 --> 00:12:42.000
You grew up here, so do you 
know where Sapphire-san is?

00:12:42.000 --> 00:12:43.820
Take me there!

00:12:43.820 --> 00:12:46.280
Of course I don't!

00:12:46.280 --> 00:12:49.130
She's a super-popular model!

00:12:49.130 --> 00:12:50.370
I'm back!

00:12:50.960 --> 00:12:52.820
Did you find your friend?

00:12:52.820 --> 00:12:55.040
Yes, thanks.

00:12:55.040 --> 00:12:58.320
Oh, did you make a friend, too?

00:13:00.010 --> 00:13:00.800
Wh-Who are you?

00:13:00.800 --> 00:13:02.760
Hey, be quiet!

00:13:02.760 --> 00:13:04.660
D-Dia-san?

00:13:05.840 --> 00:13:07.510
Who's that?

00:13:07.510 --> 00:13:10.690
The leader of this country's
Witch's Association.

00:13:11.920 --> 00:13:13.540
You're too loud!

00:13:13.540 --> 00:13:14.680
The enemy will find me!

00:13:14.680 --> 00:13:15.520
Enemy?

00:13:15.520 --> 00:13:19.020
Dia-chan, come home!

00:13:19.020 --> 00:13:21.720
There's still work to do.

00:13:21.720 --> 00:13:22.830
Fool!

00:13:22.830 --> 00:13:25.900
The reason I don't want to go home 
is that there's still work to do.

00:13:26.320 --> 00:13:28.970
Wait! Is that Ruby-san?

00:13:29.680 --> 00:13:30.960
Of the Ten Jewels?

00:13:30.960 --> 00:13:31.930
Which means...

00:13:31.930 --> 00:13:33.670
Sapphire-san's here, too?

00:13:33.670 --> 00:13:36.870
I sent Sapphire out on
an errand, so she's not here.

00:13:37.150 --> 00:13:40.980
That's why I was able to escape,
 because there were fewer people around.

00:13:40.980 --> 00:13:42.840
Aw, she's not here?

00:13:43.190 --> 00:13:46.040
You ditched your job and ran?

00:13:46.040 --> 00:13:47.720
You shouldn't do that.

00:13:47.720 --> 00:13:49.550
I know that!

00:13:49.890 --> 00:13:52.360
You're lame, you know that?

00:13:52.360 --> 00:13:55.140
No, he's right.

00:13:56.040 --> 00:13:58.140
You shouldn't run off from a job.

00:13:58.390 --> 00:13:59.860
Aquamarine-san?

00:13:59.860 --> 00:14:00.360
Tch!

00:14:00.360 --> 00:14:01.480
I see.

00:14:01.480 --> 00:14:03.510
So Ruby was a decoy?

00:14:03.510 --> 00:14:05.080
You're right.

00:14:05.080 --> 00:14:08.480
Now get back to work, Dia-san.

00:14:09.850 --> 00:14:11.670
So frustrating...

00:14:13.200 --> 00:14:16.500
The Blood Realm is kind of amazing, huh?

00:14:16.500 --> 00:14:17.970
Actually...

00:14:17.970 --> 00:14:20.490
Dia-san is a great person.

00:14:20.980 --> 00:14:23.420
I don't wanna work!

00:14:24.320 --> 00:14:26.630
Give it up already.

00:14:27.940 --> 00:14:29.300
Probably.

00:14:29.300 --> 00:14:33.260
<i>And at last, I made it to the theme park!</i>

00:14:41.390 --> 00:14:43.870
This is even better than I imagined!

00:14:43.870 --> 00:14:46.010
Wow!

00:14:47.060 --> 00:14:48.620
Amazing, huh?

00:14:49.540 --> 00:14:51.520
The Animal Realm's just as good!

00:14:51.520 --> 00:14:55.000
The Animal Realm doesn't 
have a theme park, sure,

00:14:55.000 --> 00:14:57.250
but it has lots of pretty nature!

00:14:57.690 --> 00:14:59.780
You're making fun of me, aren't you?

00:14:59.780 --> 00:15:01.060
Now, now...

00:15:03.090 --> 00:15:04.830
Where's Campanella-san?

00:15:04.830 --> 00:15:06.410
She's not here?

00:15:06.410 --> 00:15:07.880
When did she disappear?

00:15:08.520 --> 00:15:12.010
Blackpanella isn't back, huh?

00:15:12.010 --> 00:15:13.240
I sure am.

00:15:14.240 --> 00:15:15.690
When did you get here?

00:15:15.690 --> 00:15:17.270
Let's go inside!

00:15:17.720 --> 00:15:21.730
<i>By now, I was used to playing two roles,
 and things were going great!</i>

00:15:22.160 --> 00:15:24.310
<i>It was the birth of Doublepanella!</i>

00:16:03.600 --> 00:16:06.930
<i>And then there was that wonderful 
show by the Ten Jewels!</i>

00:16:08.200 --> 00:16:09.950
If this is a show by the Ten Jewels,

00:16:09.950 --> 00:16:12.350
then will I finally get to meet Sapphire-san?

00:16:12.350 --> 00:16:14.520
Yeah, it looks like she'll be here!

00:16:14.520 --> 00:16:15.410
Yes!

00:16:15.410 --> 00:16:19.960
Listen, you can "meet" her,
but she's on stage and you're not.

00:16:19.960 --> 00:16:23.480
No, I might get a shot.

00:16:23.480 --> 00:16:25.860
You will not.

00:16:26.930 --> 00:16:28.410
Wiseman!

00:16:28.410 --> 00:16:29.930
It's Haruharu!

00:16:29.930 --> 00:16:33.260
What? Did you come all this way to bother us?

00:16:33.260 --> 00:16:35.060
We're not here to bother you, guru!

00:16:35.060 --> 00:16:37.760
We're just here on a job.

00:16:37.760 --> 00:16:39.250
Stop it, Guru.

00:16:39.250 --> 00:16:40.830
Let's sit somewhere else.

00:16:40.830 --> 00:16:41.780
Yeah.

00:16:43.930 --> 00:16:48.310
Um, it looks like these 
are the only open seats.

00:16:48.720 --> 00:16:50.310
Looks like we're stuck.

00:16:52.840 --> 00:16:55.160
We're sitting next to them?

00:16:55.160 --> 00:16:58.690
You don't need to get so upset.

00:16:58.690 --> 00:16:59.870
That's right!

00:17:00.480 --> 00:17:02.810
You guys are too close.

00:17:02.810 --> 00:17:05.690
We're business rivals.

00:17:06.410 --> 00:17:08.420
The flames of jealousy burn.

00:17:08.740 --> 00:17:10.000
No way!

00:17:10.620 --> 00:17:12.840
Then I'm jealous.

00:17:14.060 --> 00:17:15.550
You're kind of scaring me.

00:17:15.870 --> 00:17:17.510
Stop it, Choco.

00:17:20.020 --> 00:17:20.930
I'm back...

00:17:24.550 --> 00:17:27.100
<i>Why are they sitting next to each other?!</i>

00:17:27.760 --> 00:17:29.980
<i>If I'm that close to both of them,</i>

00:17:29.980 --> 00:17:31.570
<i>they may find out!</i>

00:17:32.120 --> 00:17:33.580
<i>What do I do?</i>

00:17:33.580 --> 00:17:37.640
<i>But if I want to build Campanelland,</i>

00:17:37.640 --> 00:17:40.990
<i>I need to learn what I can
from the Ten Jewels show.</i>

00:17:41.840 --> 00:17:42.490
<i>Okay!</i>

00:17:42.890 --> 00:17:44.950
Why do I have to do this?

00:17:45.240 --> 00:17:47.650
I'm not a model!

00:17:47.650 --> 00:17:51.680
Is this revenge for sending you 
on that boring errand, Sapphire?

00:17:51.680 --> 00:17:53.530
What are you talking about?

00:17:53.530 --> 00:17:55.510
This was planned a long time ago.

00:17:55.810 --> 00:18:01.720
This is a super-special show, featuring all
the Ten Jewels and you, too!

00:18:02.000 --> 00:18:04.640
We've been advertising it for a long time.

00:18:04.640 --> 00:18:06.730
It's brutal overwork.

00:18:06.730 --> 00:18:10.440
I'm going to turn black!

00:18:10.810 --> 00:18:13.480
We'll listen to you complain later.

00:18:13.480 --> 00:18:14.900
It's time to start!

00:18:15.870 --> 00:18:18.000
<i>Everybody, it's time!</i>

00:18:18.000 --> 00:18:23.330
<i>A special entertainment show by the 
Blood Realm's top models, the Ten Jewels,</i>

00:18:23.330 --> 00:18:24.870
<i>is about to begin!</i>

00:18:33.530 --> 00:18:35.040
You made it, huh?

00:18:36.040 --> 00:18:38.060
You just barely made it!

00:18:40.760 --> 00:18:50.270
On that day, I'd given up 
on it lasting forever.

00:18:50.560 --> 00:18:55.720
On the other side of that tall, dark wall,

00:18:55.720 --> 00:19:01.240
I realized that hope was shining.

00:18:57.730 --> 00:18:59.210
It's Sapphire-san!

00:18:59.210 --> 00:19:00.150
She looked at me!

00:19:00.150 --> 00:19:01.240
She waved at me!

00:19:01.560 --> 00:19:11.440
The last moment passes so quickly.

00:19:03.110 --> 00:19:04.700
He's so easy.

00:19:11.440 --> 00:19:16.620
But it remains in my heart,

00:19:16.620 --> 00:19:22.060
as an unbreakable crystal.

00:19:23.890 --> 00:19:26.720
Wow, amazing!

00:19:26.720 --> 00:19:28.310
Wow!

00:19:28.660 --> 00:19:30.390
Blackblack!

00:19:28.660 --> 00:19:30.390
Campanella-san!

00:19:31.880 --> 00:19:33.520
You know Campanella-san?

00:19:31.880 --> 00:19:33.520
You know Blackblack?

00:19:33.990 --> 00:19:34.730
Blackblack?

00:19:35.080 --> 00:19:36.070
Campanella?

00:19:39.640 --> 00:19:42.720
<i>I think the jig is up.</i>

00:19:42.720 --> 00:19:45.070
Spirals!

00:19:50.460 --> 00:19:51.930
Liza, Gajeru!

00:19:51.930 --> 00:19:53.600
Mi-kun! I-chan!

00:19:55.880 --> 00:19:58.710
Oh, well. Just this once...

00:19:59.030 --> 00:20:01.160
We'll work together!

00:20:01.160 --> 00:20:02.220
Let's do it!

00:20:02.220 --> 00:20:04.210
Let's all attack at once!

00:20:04.210 --> 00:20:05.530
Okay!

00:20:08.580 --> 00:20:09.270
Here we go!

00:20:24.830 --> 00:20:27.330
Where did you think you were?

00:20:27.330 --> 00:20:29.240
This is the country of witches!

00:20:31.540 --> 00:20:36.500
As the shining world begins to shine...

00:20:36.500 --> 00:20:39.800
Sapphire-san is so amazing!

00:20:39.800 --> 00:20:41.970
Just her?

00:20:41.970 --> 00:20:45.320
Huh? Where's Campanella-san?

00:20:45.320 --> 00:20:48.120
No, that was Blackblack!

00:20:48.920 --> 00:20:50.430
They must really look alike.

00:20:51.590 --> 00:20:53.720
If you're both so certain 
it was the other person,

00:20:53.720 --> 00:20:57.630
one of you must be mistaken.

00:20:57.630 --> 00:20:58.650
I see!

00:20:58.970 --> 00:21:00.360
I see.

00:21:00.360 --> 00:21:02.780
Well, that's probably it.

00:21:02.780 --> 00:21:03.440
Yeah!

00:21:07.740 --> 00:21:10.410
This tastes amazingly like barf.

00:21:12.620 --> 00:21:14.470
I'm saved.

00:21:15.100 --> 00:21:17.830
Just this once, I owe it to the spirals.

00:21:18.520 --> 00:21:22.430
<i>And so I made it through the greatest danger,</i>

00:21:22.430 --> 00:21:25.550
<i>and played both roles on the way back.</i>

00:21:26.040 --> 00:21:29.640
<i>I made it successfully back to Hopeless.</i>

00:21:39.750 --> 00:21:40.990
I'm so tired.

00:21:40.990 --> 00:21:44.030
That was a long trip.

00:21:44.030 --> 00:21:47.300
Even I'm a little tired.

00:21:48.590 --> 00:21:51.580
Oh, you all look so tired.

00:21:52.060 --> 00:21:55.170
You're amazing, Campanella-san.

00:21:55.170 --> 00:21:56.660
You look so full of energy.

00:21:57.280 --> 00:21:59.510
That's not true.

00:21:59.510 --> 00:22:03.420
I'm twice as tired as you are.

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>Preview</b>

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>Episode 7
Animal Friends</b>

00:23:36.720 --> 00:23:38.770
"Animal Friends."
